    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mark Kelly & Associates are delighted to present this beautifully appointed, exceptionally bright and spacious 2 bedroom, 2 bathroom, corner apartment, ideally positioned within the prestigious and highly sought-after Clay Farm development and uniquely benefiting from 2 car parking spaces. \r\n\r\nOccupying a prime corner position, No. 78 enjoys a bright dual-aspect layout with an attractive open outlook to the front. The combination of natural light, privacy and generous proportions creates a wonderful sense of space throughout this impressive home. At the heart of the apartment is a superb open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, designed perfectly for modern living and entertaining. Floor-to-ceiling glazing on two sides floods the space with natural light, while a large glazed door opens directly onto the private balcony, creating a seamless connection between the indoor and outdoor living areas.\r\n\r\nThe contemporary kitchen features sleek fitted cabinetry, integrated appliances and excellent worktop space. A separate utility room adds further practicality, providing additional storage and discreetly housing the washer/dryer. Both bedrooms are spacious double rooms, with the principal bedroom benefiting from a stylish en-suite shower room. A modern main bathroom, extensive built-in storage and quality finishes throughout complete the accommodation. Built in 2023 by the renowned Park Developments Group, Kiln View was constructed to NZEB (Nearly Zero Energy Building) standards, incorporating excellent energy-efficient features including triple-glazed windows and high levels of insulation. The property also benefits from high-speed fibre broadband connectivity. \r\n\r\nCombining generous living space, contemporary finishes, excellent energy efficiency and a highly desirable corner position, No. 78 offers an exceptional opportunity to acquire a stylish, turnkey home in one of South Dublin's most sought-after residential locations. \r\n\r\nKiln View, houses just 48 exclusive residences within Clay Farm and enjoys immediate access to a wide range of amenities, with Leopardstown Valley Luas station just a short stroll away, providing a direct link to Dublin City Centre in as little as 24 minutes. The M50 motorway is also within easy reach, offering swift access to the city, airport, and the rest of the country. Leopardstown Shopping Centre is nearby for everyday needs, while Carrickmines Retail Park, just a 5-minute drive away, offers an extensive range of retail and dining options. Families are exceptionally well catered for with an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools in the area, including Holy Trinity National School, Stepaside Educate Together, Rosemont School, Thaobh na Coille, and the prestigious Nord Anglia International School. For those who enjoy the outdoors, Clay Farm boasts a unique Natural Eco Parkland at its heart, complemented by green open spaces, playgrounds, and a variety of sporting and recreational facilities, making this an ideal setting for families, , and nature enthusiasts alike."
      },
